:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Mirror Sirris []
<<if !maplebirch.get('Sydney') or !$SydneyExpansion.estate.invited or !isLoveInterest('Sydney')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The mirror shows only the tentacle plains beyond it.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      镜面另一侧仍是触手平原。
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>><<link 'Continue' 'Tentacle Plains'>><</link>>
    <<option 'CN'>><<link '继续' 'Tentacle Plains'>><</link>>
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<deadwood-reblooms-sirris-estate-presence>>
  <<if !_sydneyAtEstate>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Sydney's room is empty. The surface refuses to let you through.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        悉尼的房间空着。镜面没有让你穿过去。
    <</language>><br><br>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>><<link 'Continue' 'Tentacle Plains'>><</link>>
      <<option 'CN'>><<link '继续' 'Tentacle Plains'>><</link>>
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'sirris_estate'>><<deadwood-reblooms-mirror-exit 'sirris'>>
    <<npc Sydney>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>
    <<set _nakedArrival to $worn.over_upper.type.includes('naked')
      and $worn.over_lower.type.includes('naked')
      and $worn.upper.type.includes('naked')
      and $worn.lower.type.includes('naked')
      and $worn.under_upper.type.includes('naked')
      and $worn.under_lower.type.includes('naked')>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You squeeze through the glass and land beside Sydney's desk. <<He>> looks up from the bed. The mirror settles behind you without a sound.
        <<if _nakedArrival and (Time.hour gte 22 or Time.hour lt 6)>>
          <br><br>
          <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
            Sydney catches sight of your bare skin and quickly pulls the blanket aside. <span class='teal'>"Come here before you get cold,"</span> <<he>> whispers, cheeks warm.
          <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
            Sydney's eyes travel over you. <span class='lewd'>"You came all this way dressed like that?"</span> <<he>> asks, smiling as <<he>> lifts the blanket.
          <<else>>
            Sydney blinks at your naked body, then moves over in bed. "Is that mirror how you got here?" <<he>> asks softly.
          <</if>>
          <<if _sirrisAtEstate>> A floorboard creaks downstairs. Sydney glances at the door and lowers <<his>> voice.<</if>>
        <</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你挤过镜面，落在悉尼的书桌旁。<<He>>从床上抬起头。身后的镜子无声地恢复平静。
        <<if _nakedArrival and (Time.hour gte 22 or Time.hour lt 6)>>
          <br><br>
          <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
            悉尼瞥见你赤裸的身体，连忙掀开被角。<span class='teal'>“快过来，别着凉。”</span><<he>>低声说，脸颊渐渐发热。
          <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
            悉尼的目光沿着你的身体扫过。<span class='lewd'>“你就这样一路过来的？”</span><<he>>笑着掀开被角。
          <<else>>
            悉尼望着你赤裸的身体眨了眨眼，往床里挪出空位。“你是从镜子里过来的？”<<he>>轻声问。
          <</if>>
          <<if _sirrisAtEstate>>楼下有块地板响了一声。悉尼看向门口，压低声音。<</if>>
        <</if>>
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<if _nakedArrival and (Time.hour gte 22 or Time.hour lt 6)>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>><<loveicon>><<link 'Join Sydney under the blanket' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Mirror Night Visit'>><</link>>
        <<option 'CN'>><<loveicon>><<link '钻进悉尼的被窝' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Mirror Night Visit'>><</link>>
      <</language>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>><<getouticon>><<link "Stay in Sydney's room" 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Room'>><</link>>
      <<option 'CN'>><<getouticon>><<link '留在悉尼的房间' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Room'>><</link>>
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Mirror Night Visit []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'sirris_estate'>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-reblooms-sirris-estate-presence>>
<<if !_sydneyAtEstate or !isLoveInterest('Sydney')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Sydney has left the room.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      悉尼已经离开了房间。
  <</language>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<npc Sydney>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You slip beneath the blanket. Sydney catches your hand before you can surprise <<him>> again.
      <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>> <span class='teal'>"You could have knocked,"</span> <<he>> whispers, though <<he>> keeps your hand in <<his>>.
      <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>> <span class='lewd'>"Was the mirror only an excuse to get into my bed?"</span> <<he>> asks, drawing you closer.
      <<else>> "I wondered if you'd come back tonight," <<he>> says, making room for you.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你钻进被窝。悉尼抓住你的手，没让你再吓到<<him>>。
      <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>> <span class='teal'>“你可以先敲门。”</span><<he>>小声说，却仍握着你的手。
      <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>> <span class='lewd'>“镜子只是你钻进我被窝的借口？”</span><<he>>问着，把你拉近。
      <<else>> “我还在想，你今晚会不会回来。”<<he>>说着，往旁边挪了挪。
      <</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>><<loveicon>><<link 'Draw Sydney closer' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Intimacy'>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
    <<option 'CN'>><<loveicon>><<link '把悉尼拉近' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Intimacy'>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
  <</language>><<promiscuous1>><br>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>><<bedicon>><<link "Stay by Sydney's side" 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Room'>><</link>>
  <<option 'CN'>><<bedicon>><<link '留在悉尼身边' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Room'>><</link>>
<</language>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Mirror Kylar []
<<if !maplebirch.get('Kylar') or !$KylarExpansion.stay_invited or !isLoveInterest('Kylar')
  or C.npc.Kylar.state isnot 'active'
  or (Time.hour lt 18 and getKylarLocation().area isnot 'manor_bedroom')
  or (maplebirch.get('VP') and maplebirch.get("VP").realEstate.residenceOf('Kylar'))>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Kylar's room is out of reach. The mirror stays dark.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      凯拉尔的房间遥不可及。镜面仍是一片黑暗。
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>><<link 'Continue' 'Tentacle Plains'>><</link>>
    <<option 'CN'>><<link '继续' 'Tentacle Plains'>><</link>>
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<deadwood-reblooms-mirror-exit 'kylar'>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<set _nakedArrival to $worn.over_upper.type.includes('naked')
    and $worn.over_lower.type.includes('naked')
    and $worn.upper.type.includes('naked')
    and $worn.lower.type.includes('naked')
    and $worn.under_upper.type.includes('naked')
    and $worn.under_lower.type.includes('naked')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You tumble out of the mirror in Kylar's room. <<He>> spins in <<his>> chair, one hand already reaching beneath the desk. When <<he>> recognises you, <<he>> lets it fall.
      <<if _nakedArrival and (Time.hour gte 22 or Time.hour lt 6)>>
        <br><br>
        Kylar's gaze catches on your bare skin. <span class='lewd'>"I thought you were a stranger,"</span> <<he>> says, pulling the sheets back for you.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你从凯拉尔房间的镜子里跌出来。<<He>>猛地转过椅子，一只手已经探向桌下。认出你后，<<he>>才松开手。
      <<if _nakedArrival and (Time.hour gte 22 or Time.hour lt 6)>>
        <br><br>
        凯拉尔的目光落在你赤裸的身体上。<span class='lewd'>“我还以为是陌生人。”</span><<he>>说着，为你掀开被子。
      <</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>><<bedicon 'kylar'>><<link "Stay in Kylar's room" 'Manor Kylar Room'>><</link>>
    <<option 'CN'>><<bedicon 'kylar'>><<link '留在凯拉尔的房间' 'Manor Kylar Room'>><</link>>
  <</language>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Conduct []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'forest_shop'>><<effects>><<npc Gwylan>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Gwylan')>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You tell Gwylan that you want to lead the next cleansing. You have felt the forest's <span class="purple">poison squirm through your body</span> often enough.
    This time, you want it to follow your rhythm.
  <br><br>
  <<He>> stops arranging the bottles behind the counter. <<His>> gaze lingers on you. "You've learned how it moves through you," <<he>> says. "And
    the forest answers when you open yourself to it. That doesn't mean it belongs to you."
  <br><br>
  <<He>> selects several bottles and places them in a case. "You may set the pace and guide the current. I'll prepare the reagents and hold the seal.
    <span class="red">If I tell you to stop, you stop.</span> It doesn't matter how good it feels if the poison escapes back into the world."
  <br><br>
  <span class="lewd">A familiar heat stirs inside you.</span> Gwylan notices, and smiles. "Very well. Show me what your body has learned."
  <br><br>
  <<link [[Begin the cleansing|Gwylan Ritual Start]]>><<run maplebirch.get("VP").deviancy.begin()>><</link>>
  <br>
  <<link [[Not today|Forest Shop Entrance]]>><</link>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你告诉格威岚，下一场净化仪式想由自己主持。<span class="purple">森林的毒素已经在你的身体里蠕动过太多次。</span>这一次，你想让它顺从你的节奏。
  <br><br>
  <<He>>停下整理柜台后方瓶罐的动作，目光在你身上停留片刻。“你已经学会毒素如何在体内游走，”<<he>>说道，“当你主动向森林敞开身体，它也会回应你。
    但这不代表它属于你。”
  <br><br>
  <<He>>挑出几只瓶子，放进箱中。“你可以控制节奏，引导毒素的流向。药剂和封印仍由我负责。<span class="red">我让你停下时，你就必须停下。</span>
    无论过程多么舒服，毒素若重新逃回这个世界，净化就不算成功。”
  <br><br>
  <span class="lewd">熟悉的热意在你体内浮现。</span>格威岚注意到了，露出微笑。“很好。让我看看你的身体都学会了什么。”
  <br><br>
  <<link [[开始净化仪式|Gwylan Ritual Start]]>><<run maplebirch.get("VP").deviancy.begin()>><</link>>
  <br>
  <<link [[今天还是算了|Forest Shop Entrance]]>><</link>>
<</language>>
